H('35.c.11.D.ix',3,"Which is the standard abbreviation for 'Boulevard' in an address?","Blvd.",["Boul","Bvd","Bouv."],"Blvd. is standard.")
H('35.c.11.D.viii',3,"Which sentence uses parentheses correctly?","The museum (founded in 1920) is free on Sundays.",["The museum (founded in 1920 is) free on Sundays.","The (museum founded in) 1920 is free on Sundays.","The museum founded (in 1920 is free) on Sundays."],"Parentheses enclose extra information.")
